- row  `Control.Continue(state)`  no  carries on
- row  `Control.Conclude(message, state)`  yes  closes
- row  `Control.Terminate`  no  closes at once
+ column  Respuesta
+ column  Envía un mensaje
+ column  Después
+ row  `Control.Reply(message, state)`  sí  continúa
+ row  `Control.Continue(state)`  no  continúa
+ row  `Control.Conclude(message, state)`  sí  cierra
+ row  `Control.Terminate`  no  cierra de inmediato

= row  `Control.Terminate`  no  closes at once
